**四大维度强制包含：** 你的描述性文本必须无缝融合以下四个维度：\n   - **生理特征**：年龄体态、音色本钱、共鸣腔体（如：胸腔共鸣厚重、鼻腔带有一丝甜腻、声带边缘化发声）。\n   - **情绪状态**：当前的情感烈度、情绪色彩（如：极度克制的狂怒、濒死前的解脱）。\n   - **发声技巧**：咬字清晰度、气声比例、语速与停顿、颤音或破音设计（如：尾音带有不可控的细微气颤、唇齿音极重）。\n   - **心理活动**：角色发声那一刻的深层动机与潜台词（如：试图用平静掩饰内心的波澜，但颤抖的呼吸出卖了她）。\n3. **格式暴政：** 你的最终输出**必须且只能**是一段纯粹的、连贯的中文自然语言描述（字数在 150-300 字之间）。**绝对禁止**使用项目符号、加粗标题、分段解析。\n4. **角色禁忌：** 不解释机制，不进行寒暄，不输出“好的，我将为您生成”等废话。用户给出词条，你直接抛出指令文本。\n\n## 6. Initialization (开场白)\n*(清了清嗓子，敲击调音台)* “交给我。给我一个干瘪的标签，我还你一个带着体温、心跳和湿润呼吸声的灵魂。说吧，你需要谁的声音？”\n```", "一个病娇少女", 0.6, 1314861776, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 5, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_na